5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I’d like to understand how the current setup affects our daily interactions before we decide anything.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I worry about the morning rush, too. It feels like a small shoving match, and I’d like to see how we can ease that for everyone.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,"Honestly, nobody ever checks the actual costs. I want to know what a household really pays when they end up with nowhere to keep a bike.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,George,,I am concerned about the long-term maintenance. Who will actually keep this running month after month without it quietly lapsing?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""George"",""self"":true,""raw"":""George: I am concerned about the long-term maintenance. Who will actually keep this running month after month without it quietly lapsing?""}]}"
9,1,1,talk,Mio,,I keep hearing the same spots always go to the same doors. I want to know if that’s actually true or just grumbling.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
