11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, I hope it is just a feeling. I will look into the morning departures to see if the layout is truly causing the trouble.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@George, exactly! I’m checking the ledger and the station park to see what we’d actually pay if we had to go outside.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
