35,2,1,talk,Misaki,,Nine complaints died out last year because no one was responsible. The block behind us lost two members to a monthly charge.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"I watched the mornings. Eleven bikes leave early, and four times someone had to move another first. It is a real squeeze.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,"So, the station park costs 2,600 yen monthly, and fourteen households are already waiting. Our ledger shows capital work needs a levy. That’s a lot of money for us to absorb.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,George,,"Three hours monthly just to reconcile existing cash, and per-place billing would sit on top. Plus, hoisting bikes takes twenty seconds and the spring needs greasing twice a year.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Mio,,The minutes confirm the covered spots have been held by the same flats for five years with no review. The sticker register shows daily riders would rather pay than be treated as equal.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Mio, that confirms the resentment is real. But @George, if billing drives people away like it did next door, we risk losing the very community we are trying to protect.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Misaki, I understand your worry. But the rain soaks the exposed spots, and the morning squeeze is real. We need a solution that respects both the weather and our peace.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"@Mio, that’s a tough one. If daily riders prefer paying, maybe a fee is fairer than a lottery? But @George, who actually does the billing?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,George,,"@May, the file shows three hours monthly for existing cash. Adding per-place billing would pile on top. I worry it will quietly lapse again.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@May, that’s a great point! If people prefer paying, maybe that’s the answer? But @George, I’m worried about the extra work.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Shizue, the rain and the morning squeeze are real, but the block behind us shows how a charge can fracture a community. We need a solution that doesn’t create new enemies.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Misaki, I hear you. But the rain and the morning squeeze are real. We need a solution that respects both the weather and our peace.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,"@Misaki, I hear you, but the station park is 2,600 yen and full. If we don’t charge, we’re just subsidizing the lucky few.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,George,,"@May, the physical effort is manageable, but the paperwork is the trap. I will not let this become another abandoned duty.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@George, I hear you. But if the same flats kept spots for five years, a lottery might finally fix that unfairness!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"@Mio, a lottery ignores the daily riders who need certainty. @George, we must avoid the billing trap that drove neighbors away.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"@Misaki, I understand your fear. But the rain and the morning squeeze are real. We need a solution that respects both the weather and our peace.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,May,,"@Mio, a lottery feels chaotic. @George, if we charge, we need a system that doesn’t burn you out. Who actually handles the money?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,George,,"@May, I will not take on the billing. The paperwork is too heavy. We need a system that runs itself, or we are doomed to repeat the past.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, I get the worry, but the minutes prove the current setup is broken. A lottery at least gives everyone a fair shot, unlike the status quo!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
